{"id":"90dc104b21b5c21e","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-substructure.md","title":"Substructure","display":"df-substructure — Substructure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-substructure","aliases":["57-df-substructure"],"display":"df-substructure — Substructure","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-function-restriction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-substructure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-substructure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substructure — Substructure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"691f08ea84f57992\" href=\"?note=691f08ea84f57992\" title=\"57-df-function-restriction\">57-df-function-restriction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 为候选同签名结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}\\)</span> 和各符号解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。常量、函数、关系的分组见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>，函数限制见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"691f08ea84f57992\" href=\"?note=691f08ea84f57992\" title=\"57-df-function-restriction\">57-df-function-restriction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\land A\\subseteq B\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak A}=f^{\\mathfrak B}\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}A^n)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n(R^{\\mathfrak A}=R^{\\mathfrak B}\\cap A^n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\land A\\subseteq B\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak A}=f^{\\mathfrak B}\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}A^n)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n(R^{\\mathfrak A}=R^{\\mathfrak B}\\cap A^n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>限制函数时使用输入元组载体 A^n，而不是 A；常量比较是等式，不是局部引入新符号的定义号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-function-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"691f08ea84f57992","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-function-restriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为候选同签名结构；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，$\\mathrm{Struct}$ 和各符号解释见 [[57-df-structure]]。常量、函数、关系的分组见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]，函数限制见 [[57-df-function-restriction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为候选同签名结构；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，$\\mathrm{Struct}$ 和各符号解释见 [[57-df-structure]]。常量、函数、关系的分组见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]，函数限制见 [[57-df-function-restriction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-function-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"691f08ea84f57992","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为候选同签名结构；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，$\\mathrm{Struct}$ 和各符号解释见 [[57-df-structure]]。常量、函数、关系的分组见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]，函数限制见 [[57-df-function-restriction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"B=|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\land A\\subseteq B\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak A}=f^{\\mathfrak B}\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}A^n)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n(R^{\\mathfrak A}=R^{\\mathfrak B}\\cap A^n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1212,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d3445b68d4cfbdb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6a7fe4775125052f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为同签名结构；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$。子结构见 [[57-df-substructure]]；$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、赋值与满足关系见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-assignment]]、[[57-df-satisfaction]]。$A\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|$ 时同一函数 $\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A$ 也作为 $\\mathfrak B$ 的赋值。"},{"id":"2830229fa8f44c6a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为只含常量及有限正元函数符号的一阶字母表，$\\mathrm{Rel}_S=\\varnothing$，结构载体非空。$\\mathcal K$ 为 $S$-结构类；$\\mathrm{Hom}$、子结构、$\\mathrm{UC}$ 及集合族直积分别取 [[57-df-homomorphism]]、[[57-df-substructure]]、[[57-df-universal-closure]]、[[57-df-indexed-product]]。$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为任意集合指标结构族，允许 $I=\\varnothing$；$D=\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|$。下面给出其结构直积解释 $J$；$c$、$f$、$n$ 遍历各自符号类型，$\\vec a\\in D^n$。类表达式用背景 ZFC 的类模式解释；$\\mathcal K\\in\\mathrm{Variety}$ 是类参数上的谓词记号，并不声称真类是集合的元素。"},{"id":"b1c18a144a85b6d5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"617923ff5edce923","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3559f03aaa45d061","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b73b77ae86e33532","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b576240540ebc13e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak B \\subseteq \\mathfrak A$ (子